  "body": "## Release Notes\n[v0.38.1](https://github.com/determined-ai/determined/blob/v0.38.1/docs/release-notes.rst)\n\n## Changelog\n* 6bcda5dd3 docs: add release notes for 0.38.1 (#10258)\n* edede259a chore: pin aiohttp-cors (#10257)\n* 7f50cfb63 docs: update dependencies (#10256)\n* 9ca0efd49 ci: allow release candidate triggers helm chart upload (#10255)\n* 5c2b884aa ci: fix incorrect field key in the goreleaser and rc label (#10254)\n* 20d4553a0 docs: add warning to the obsolete docs and update links (#10252)\n* 3a8839e59 chore: upgrade swagger-ui to v5.20.0 (#10250)\n* af0a6f781 ci: fix oss and ee release process and add ee-dryrun release process (#10249)\n* d90dd4cc1 ci: remove dependency on codecov (#10238)\n* d60d236fe build(deps): bump golang.org/x/crypto from 0.24.0 to 0.31.0 (#10236)\n* a0ce6767c ci: remove deploying latest gke cluster (#10235)\n* 21f3c737d ci: remove deploying latest main and preview clusters (#10234)\n* eb7eb8adc ci: fix apex installation [DT-5] (#10233)\n* 49eb16601 test: update CI setup for running GPU unit tests (#10230)\n* ad01f85fb chore: 0.38.1 environment images (#10247)\n* 43a9498db fix: A less-than/greater-than error in the daist stdout logging filter.\n\n"
}
